'''Mega-Mooth''' (ギガガガ, ''Gigagaga'') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]/[[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] variant of [[Mooth]] unique to the [[Mega Menace]] event. He was added in [[Version 9.6 Update|Version 9.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Mega-Mooth
|image = E 515.png
|appearance = [[Mega Menace]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,295¢
}}

==Enemy==
Mega-Mooth is an [[Othom]]-like enemy with 30 more effective and standing range, allowing him to hit even [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]. He has more knockbacks than Othom, but is supported by [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]], [[Brollow]]s and [[Professor A.]] in [[Mega Menace/On Mighty Wings Lv1~20|On Mighty Wings Lv11~20]]. Like other [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus Enemies]], he gets more and more powerful with each stage. To top it all off, he knocks back everything he hits, forming a devastating combination with [[Gabriel]]s and [[Gory Dark]]s or Brollows and Other Miscellaneous Zombies.

==Strategy==
:''See [[Mega Menace/On Mighty Wings Lv1~20]] for Strategies.''

