==Trivia==
*Mega-Mooth's Japanese name, Gigagaga, is a portmanteau of ''giga'' and [[Mooth]]'s Japanese name, Gagagaga; ''ga'' means "moth".
*Mega-Mooth may be a reference to [[wikipedia:Mothra|Mothra]], a giant moth kaiju introduced in the [[wikipedia:Mothra (film)|1961 film of the same name]].
*Curiously, Mega-Mooth lacks legs, unlike other Mooth variants. This may be a result of genome editing.
*He is one of the six enemies that were updated to have the [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] type in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]], the others being [[Baron Seal]], [[Le'Grim]], [[Super Hyppoh]], [[Archangel Exiel]] and [[Big Peng Z]].

